branch not_equal corrupt_state
load_memory_u32 ecx r8 none 1 12
test ecx ecx
branch equal initialize_state
compare_i32 ecx 1396790871
branch not_equal corrupt_state
load_memory_u32 ecx r8 none 1 20
compare_i32 ecx 1048576
branch above corrupt_state
load_memory_u32 ecx r8 none 1 24
